  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こんばんは──じゃなくて\r\nこんにちは……かな、ギリギリ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　こんにちは！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ひとりか？\r\n──というか、平日だから学校は？　かな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "社会科見学だったんですー！\r\nもう終わって、帰ってるところです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんはどうしたんですか？\r\nお仕事ですよね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、そうだよ\r\nちょっと都合で社用車が使えなくて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "タクシーでもよかったんだけど、\r\nちょうどいいところにバスが来たからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わぁ……っ\r\nお疲れ様ですっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040070"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "大人の人って、\r\n一日中お仕事しててスゴいですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうかな\r\n果穂だって仕事してるだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂も俺も変わらないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、あたしは毎日じゃないです……っ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは……そうだなぁ\r\nでもな、俺も果穂のことをすごいって思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしですか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0220",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\n学校に行って、友達と遊んで、勉強して",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その上、アイドルになって、\r\nレッスンしたり、仕事したり、色々やってる",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "な？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 400
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そう……なんでしょうか",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "autoWaitTime": 600
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そっか……えへへ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっきさ、\r\n今日は社会科見学に行ったって言ってたよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その話、もっと聞かせてほしいな",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "どこに行ってきたんだ？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
