  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "電話とかの部品を作ってて……\r\nスッゴく昔のけい帯を見せてもらいました！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ボタンがたくさんあってびっくりしましたー！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか、果穂くらいだとそこからか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、時代だなぁと思って\r\n俺が果穂くらいの頃は、持ってない人が多かったんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……！\r\nそうなんですか……！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "え、じゃあ\r\n友達とチェインしたり、勉強したりもしないんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200901404/2009014040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しなかったなぁ……\r\n──というか、スマホで勉強ってどういう……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009014040200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ビデオ通話するんです！\r\n一緒に勉強できるんですよっ",
